cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. The CMAI itself is cited separately: Cohen-Mansfield, J. (1991). Instruction Manual for the Cohen-Mansfield Agitation Inventory."
title: "CMAI Tracker"
abstract: "A caregiver web app that logs Cohen-Mansfield Agitation Inventory behaviors as they happen and converts each 14-day period's counts into 1 to 7 ratings with a written, tested rule."
type: software
